  enhance ~ 1.0 everywhere means NO concentration: the walk leaves the
  hypercube distribution essentially uniform and the decode is averaging
  noise. In that case neither the mixer nor the decoder is the bottleneck -
  the marking itself is too weak, and the quantity to check next is the
  PHASE SPREAD the imprint writes, (max E - min E) * t, against pi.
  enhance >> 1 with mode == x* means the concentration is real and the
  weighted-mean decode is throwing it away.
